{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 1869,
    "dDurationMs": 6671,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Did you know that after the 1986 Chernobyl\nnuclear disaster at reactor number four, that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 8540,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the other reactors on that site were not shut\ndown permanently?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12940,
    "dDurationMs": 4210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In fact, they were kept running, producing\nelectricity by workers who were brought in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 17150,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by train every day to work on those other\nreactors, the last of which was shut down"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21370,
    "dDurationMs": 2249,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "around the year 2000."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 23619,
    "dDurationMs": 4111,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is just one of the many surprising facts\nI found out while shooting a documentary for"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 27730,
    "dDurationMs": 4050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "TV which is called Uranium: Twisting the Dragon’s\nTail."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 31780,
    "dDurationMs": 3910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now while we were shooting this documentary\nI would take out my little camera and shot"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 35690,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "small pieces while they were setting up the\nbig camera."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 38570,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is James."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40430,
    "dDurationMs": 1359,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Hello."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41789,
    "dDurationMs": 4371,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e But that has allowed me to make some YouTube\nvideos for you, including the most radioactive"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46160,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "places on earth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 47160,
    "dDurationMs": 3039,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I will have a few more of those videos\ncoming out very soon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50199,
    "dDurationMs": 3721,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what I wanted to show you was the trailer\nfor this documentary."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53920,
    "dDurationMs": 3119,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I want you guys to check out this trailer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 57039,
    "dDurationMs": 4181,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let me know what you think and I will put\nat the end of the trailer the dates that this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 61220,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "documentary will be aired in your area."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 62980,
    "dDurationMs": 3430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It will be played in the US and Australia\nand in Europe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 66410,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So stay tuned to the end of this trailer to\ncheck out when it will be on in your neck"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 70470,
    "dDurationMs": 1210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the woods."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 71680,
    "dDurationMs": 4290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So thank you guys so much for watching this\nYouTube channel, because without it, I never"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 75970,
    "dDurationMs": 3490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "would have got the job hosting this TV documentary."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79460,
    "dDurationMs": 1070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I really hope you enjoy it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 80530,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We put so much work into it and it looks amazing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 83530,
    "dDurationMs": 2060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So check it out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85590,
    "dDurationMs": 3820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here it is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 89410,
    "dDurationMs": 5800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Legends say there is a world beneath this\none where a dragon lies sleeping."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95210,
    "dDurationMs": 12020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They say: Be careful how you wake the dragon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107230,
    "dDurationMs": 4570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Around the turn of the 20th century Uranium\nis almost unknown."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 111800,
    "dDurationMs": 1370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is basically worthless."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 113170,
    "dDurationMs": 7040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But then in 40 years, just a single generation,\nit becomes the most desirable and terrifying"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120210,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "rock on earth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 122790,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is uranium."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 124550,
    "dDurationMs": 4469,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And as a physicist, I am fascinated by its\nunique scientific properties."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 129019,
    "dDurationMs": 7541,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But even more so by how this one rock has\nshaped the entire modern world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 136560,
    "dDurationMs": 7530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Uranium changes everything."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 144090,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Uranium makes the modern world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 147930,
    "dDurationMs": 1639,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Uranium is a dream."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 149569,
    "dDurationMs": 2191,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Clean, limitless power."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 151760,
    "dDurationMs": 3869,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or a nightmare of a silent and poisoned earth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 155629,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Oh, it is hot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 157109,
    "dDurationMs": 1481,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is hot here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 158590,
    "dDurationMs": 1479,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is really hot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 160069,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e It’s overloaded."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 161069,
    "dDurationMs": 6271,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Come with me on a journey to find the most\ndesirable..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 167340,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e This is a nuclear reactor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169530,
    "dDurationMs": 6019,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e And the most hated rock on earth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 175549,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e It is just that fear."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176849,
    "dDurationMs": 3310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If it blows, what is going to happen to it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 180159,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e How did we unleash the elemental force\nwithin uranium?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184379,
    "dDurationMs": 5390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What happened when we woke the dragon?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 189769,
    "dDurationMs": 3650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e This is the story of how a rock changed\nthe world."
    } ]
  } ]
}
